  "text": "Toronto Veterinary Clinic | Central Toronto Veterinary Referral Clinic\nSkip to Primary Content\nMedication Refill Request Form\nContact Us\nContact Us\nMap\n1051 Eglinton Avenue West,\nToronto,\nON,\nM6C 2C9\nCall\n(416) 784-4444\nER Check-in Online\nER Check-in Online\nPhone:\n(416) 784-4444\nAddress:\n1051 Eglinton Avenue West,\nToronto,\nON,\nM6C 2C9\nBlog\nCareers\nMedication Refill Request Form\nAbout Us\nLearn More\nOur Team\nGallery\nServices\nAnesthesiology\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nView All Services\n24/7 Emergency Care\nFor Pet Owners\nReferrals\nEmergency Visits\nPayment Portal\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Veterinarians\nBlog\nMedication Refill Request Form\nER Check-in Online\nContact Us\nVisit our Toronto Clinic\nView the Hospital Tour\nQuality Care in Toronto, ON\nCall us at (416) 784-4444\nContact Us\nBefore Your ER Visit\nText\nCTVRC to (226)407-9573\nFor specialty appointments, please check in upon arrival.\nIf your pet is in critical condition, please call and bring them immediately.\nER Check-in Online\nVisit our Toronto Clinic\nView the Hospital Tour\nQuality Care in Toronto, ON\nCall us at (416) 784-4444\nContact Us\nBefore Your ER Visit\nText\nCTVRC to (226)407-9573\nFor specialty appointments, please check in upon arrival.\nIf your pet is in critical condition, please call and bring them immediately.\nER Check-in Online\nVisit our Toronto Clinic\nView the Hospital Tour\nCentral Toronto Veterinary Referral Clinic\nSERVING THE TORONTO COMMUNITY WITH OUTSTANDING PATIENT CARE\nCentral Toronto Veterinary Referral Clinic is a leading animal care facility in Toronto. We use cutting edge technologies and diagnostics to deliver the quality service that your companion deserves. Our clinic offers not only the best medical knowledge, experience and technology, but also top-quality care rooted in the kindness, understanding and professionalism of our staff.\nSurgery\nOphthalmology\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nOphthalmology\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nOphthalmology\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nOur Clinic\nFounded by\nDr. Devon Boyd\nand\nDr. Michael Goldstein\n, CTVRC is a veterinary emergency and referral hospital in the Humewood/Cedarvale neighbourhood in Toronto. We provide our patients with the best available treatment combined with outstanding patient care. Our Toronto veterinary clinic provides consultations for\nsurgery\n,\ninternal medicine\n,\noncology\n, and\nophthalmology\n, as well as advanced diagnostics through an on-site CT scanner, ultrasound, and digital radiography.\nChoose CTVRC as your referral clinic where we understand that your companion is an important part of your family. Our Eglinton veterinary facilities are conveniently located for all your companion's needs.\nView the Hospital Tour\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(416) 784-4444\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nCentral Toronto Veterinary Referral Clinic\n1051 Eglinton Avenue West\nToronto\n,\nON\nM6C 2C9\nT:\n(416) 784-4444\nE:\n[email protected]\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nServices\nFor Pet Owners\nFor Veterinarians\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
